@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Student
actor Faculty
actor Admin
actor "AI Service" as AI
rectangle "AI-SmartProjectReviewer" {
  (Submit Project) as SP
  (Parse Document) as PD
  (View My Projects) as VMP
  (View All Projects) as VAP
  (Auto-Evaluate) as AE
  (Get Evaluation) as GE
  (Faculty Review) as FR
  (Update Project Status) as UPS
  (Manage Users) as MU
  (Manage Departments) as MD
}

Student --> SP
Student --> PD
Student --> VMP
Student --> GE
Faculty --> VAP
Faculty --> FR
Faculty --> UPS
Admin --> MU
Admin --> MD

SP .> AE : <<includes>>
AE .. AI : <<uses>>
FR .> AE : <<related to>>

note right of SP
  Typical flow: Student submits project (web form
  or document parse) -> background AI evaluation
  -> evaluation stored -> student/faculty view results.
end note

@enduml
